@post_election
on-arrival: {!
// set congress proportion to votes
Q.sfio_r = Q.sfio_votes;
Q.z_r = Q.z_votes;
Q.pcf_r = Q.pcf_votes;
Q.ddp_r = Q.ddp_votes;
Q.dvp_r = Q.dvp_votes;
Q.fr_r = Q.fr_votes;
Q.nsdap_r = Q.nsdap_votes;
Q.other_r = Q.other_votes;

// The largest party can only be the NSDAP or the SFIO.
Q.largest_party = 'SFIO';
if (Q.nsdap_r >= Q.sfio_r && Q.nsdap_r >= Q.pcf_r) {
    Q.largest_party = 'NSDAP';
}
if (Q.pcf_r >= Q.sfio_r && Q.pcf_r >= Q.nsdap_r) {
    Q.largest_party = 'PCF';
}

// coalitions
Q.weimar_coalition = Q.sfio_r + Q.ddp_r + Q.z_r - 3;
Q.grand_coalition = Q.sfio_r + Q.ddp_r + Q.z_r + Q.dvp_r;
Q.bourgeois_coalition = Q.ddp_r + Q.z_r + Q.dvp_r + Q.other_r;
Q.center_right_coalition = Q.z_r + Q.ddp_r + Q.dvp_r + Q.other_r + Q.fr_r;
Q.right_coalition = Q.z_r + Q.dvp_r + Q.other_r + Q.fr_r;
Q.far_right_coalition = Q.fr_r + Q.nsdap_r;
Q.left_coalition = Q.sfio_r + Q.pcf_r;
// this is an absurd concept lol
Q.united_front_coalition = Q.sfio_r + Q.pcf_r + Q.z_r + Q.ddp_r - 3;
Q.anti_democratic_coalition = Q.pcf_r + Q.nsdap_r;
// aka everyone except nazi, pcf, fr
Q.neo_weimar_coalition = Q.sfio_r + Q.ddp_r + Q.z_r + Q.dvp_r + Q.other_r;
!}

The electoral system is essentially proportional, with the proportion of Reichstag seats roughly equal to the proportion of votes.
 
**Election results:**

# 1928: 30, 1930: 25, 1932: 22
SFIO: [+ sfio_r +]

# 1928: 15, 1930: 15, 1932: 
Z + BVP: [+ z_r +]

# 1928: 10, 1930: 13
PCF: [+ pcf_r +]

# 1928: 5, 1930: 4 (as DstP)
DDP: [+ ddp_r +]

# 1928: 9, 1930: 5
DVP: [+ dvp_r +]

# 1928: 14, 1930: 7
FR: [+ fr_r +]

# 1928: 3, 1930: 18
NSDAP: [+ nsdap_r +]

# 1928: 9, 1930: 10
Other: [+ other_r +]

**Potential coalitions:**

Weimar Coalition (SFIO + Z + DDP): [+ weimar_coalition +]

Grand Coalition (SFIO + Z + BVP + DDP + DVP): [+ grand_coalition +]

Bourgeois Coalition (Z + BVP + DDP + DVP + Others): [+ bourgeois_coalition +]

Right-wing Coalition (Z + BVP + DVP + Others + FR): [+ right_coalition +]

